 ["h2", "runners-knee", "Runner's knee (nyeri patelofemoral)", "Runner's knee (patellofemoral pain)"],
 ["p", "Nyeri patelofemoral adalah nyeri di sekitar tempurung lutut yang muncul saat sendi lutut menerima beban tinggi — turun tangga, jongkok, lari di turunan, atau duduk lama dengan lutut ditekuk [2]. Konsensus internasional di British Journal of Sports Medicine merekomendasikan latihan sebagai penanganan utama, khususnya kombinasi penguatan otot pinggul dan lutut [1].",
  "Patellofemoral pain is pain around the kneecap that appears when the knee is under high load — stairs down, squats, downhill running, or long sitting with bent knees [2]. An international consensus in the British Journal of Sports Medicine recommends exercise as the primary treatment, particularly combined hip and knee strengthening [1]."],
